<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>MTU - 标签 - SA的自留地 &amp; 重启计划</title><link>https://moe.sakanoy.com/tags/mtu/</link><description>MTU - 标签 - SA的自留地 &amp; 重启计划</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>kerronex@gmail.com (Kerronex)</managingEditor><webMaster>kerronex@gmail.com (Kerronex)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://moe.sakanoy.com/tags/mtu/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MTU的作用</title><link>https://moe.sakanoy.com/mtu%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8/</link><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author><name>Kerronex</name></author><guid>https://moe.sakanoy.com/mtu%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><strong>MTU（Maximum Transmission Unit，最大传输单元）</strong>，指的是网络设备在<strong>一个数据帧（frame）中</strong>能够承载的<strong>最大有效载荷字节数</strong>。通俗地说：一次「打包发货」时，包裹最多能装多少货。</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>